{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2023-04-25 20:41:00', 'title': 'ROCKWELL AUTOMATION AND DOOSAN UNITE TO FORM PARTNERSHIP AS THE U.S. AND SOUTH KOREA CELEBRATE HISTORIC ANNIVERSARY', 'text': "MILWAUKEE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (NYSE: ROK), THE WORLD'S LARGEST COMPANY DEDICATED TO INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION, TODAY SIGNED A MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING TO FORM A PARTNERSHIP WITH LEADING GLOBAL ROBOT MANUFACTURER DOOSAN ROBOTICS AND ITS PARENT COMPANY DOOSAN CORPORATION, BOTH SEOUL-BASED ENTITIES AND MEMBERS OF THE HISTORIC SUMMIT IN WASHINGTON, D.C., COMMEMORATING THE 70TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE U.S. – SOUTH KOREA ALLIANCE. THE AGREEMENT SIGNING CER."}